attles by the indestructible submarine, Nautilus and the conflict between Captain Nemo and the Gargoyle. It’s a shorter, more streamlined version of Nadia called \"The Nautilus Story\", which all but eliminates the filler arc and concentrates on the struggle between Nemo and Gargoyle. Some scenes in the more pivotal episodes are cut as well. The compilation series was made by Hideaki Anno, who was said to have been dissatisfied with the final result of the TV show. The Nautilus Story was only released in Japan on VHS and laserdisc.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ftHXqpyy9t8zHjYP1d4AtdM255H.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":1252,"malId":1252},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:1252","mal:1252"],"imdbSource":"anibridge-v3","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"40","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"603","scope":"R","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"104067"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1252","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3381"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt0160558","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"1252","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"3381"},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"121139","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"24710","scope":"s0","ranges":{"1":"11"}},{"provider":"tvdb_movie","id":"64253","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81789","scope":"s0","ranges":{"1":"11"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":5544,"title":"Fushigi no Umi no Nadia: Original Movie (ITA)","title_eng":"Nadia: The Secret of Blue Water - The Motion Picture (ITA)","slug":"nadia-the-secret-of-blue-water-the-motion-picture-ita","plot":"Tre anni dopo la sconfitta di Gargoyle e Neo-Atlantis, una nuova minaccia incombe sulla Terra. Il malvagio Geiger, utilizzando una tecnologia robotica avanzata progettata dal Professor Whola, sta tentando di iniziare una guerra mondiale per prendere il controllo dell'intero pianet